            "\n",
            "\\textbf{Approach and baselines}.\n",
            "We use OK-VQA~\\cite{okvqa2019cvpr} as an example of commonsense-augmented VQA and VQAv2~\\cite{goyal2017vqav2} as a visually intensive VQA problem.\n",
