            "\n",
            "\\modelname is not just imitating the text-only model outputs.\n",
            "Instead, \\modelname adaptively fuses the commonsense understanding capability of the text-only model with the visual conditioning of the VLM.\n",
            "\n",
            "\\textbf{Results: maintaining visual specificity}.\n",
